So, I'm chugging through the Gnomish Mines, slashing baddies with
Excalibur, tossing gems at Unicorns, that sort of thing...

Suddenly, Morpheus the Ninja (9th level Samurai... almost ready for that
quest!) turns into Morpheus the Barrow Wight!  Yipes!

I _suspect_ that I was "infected" when a barrow wight hit me/cursed me a
few levels back...  Does anyone know how I could cure myself?  I've got
quite a few more hit points as a Samurai...  I tried eating a clove of
garlic, but that just made me feel sick.

Maybe it's just a normal polymorph, and I'll turn back when my hit
points get taken down to 0; then again, with a -12 armour class, nobody
can touch me...

Oh, NetHack 3.1 is the culprit...  Finally, I get a decent game going,
and I turn into a much wimpier monster...  Sheesh!

